# Everyday language (doctors vs patients)

| They say | Route |
| --- | --- |
| **doctors**, physicians, HCPs, US customers | **`STG_US`** — do not ask Dev / Stage / Prod |
| **patients**, consumers | **`DTC`** — do not ask HCP vs DTC |
| people / customers / audience (no noun) | Ask **“Doctors or patients?”** only |

Never ask which environment unless they name one (*in Prod*).

One plain-English progress line, then work silently. Do not mention skill files, schemas, or SQL in progress text.

Count answers and Query intro: [COUNT.md](../../skill/d360-segments-activations/COUNT.md).
Patient create/update: ask CIA ([CREATE.md](../../skill/d360-segments-activations/CREATE.md)). Every publish uses lookback **P2Y**.
